{"seq":2,"slug":"istio-linkerd","title":"Istio 与 Linkerd 实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-mesh/istio-linkerd","wordCount":1265,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"istio-与-linkerd-实战\">Istio 与 Linkerd 实战</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Istio 和 Linkerd 是 Kubernetes 生态中两大主流服务网格实现，均为 CNCF 毕业项目。Istio 由 Google、IBM 和 Lyft 联合开发，以功能全面著称；Linkerd 由 Buoyant 开发，以轻量和简洁著称。两者都基于 Sidecar 代理模式，但在架构设计、功能范围和运维复杂度上存在显著差异。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Istio 架构&#10;        A1[istiod 控制面] --&gt; B1[Envoy Sidecar]&#10;        A1 --&gt; C1[Envoy Sidecar]&#10;        A1 --&gt; D1[Istio Ingress Gateway]&#10;        B1 &lt;--&gt; C1&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Linkerd 架构&#10;        A2[Control Plane] --&gt; B2[linkerd2-proxy]&#10;        A2 --&gt; C2[linkerd2-proxy]&#10;        A2 --&gt; D2[Linkerd Gateway]&#10;        B2 &lt;--&gt; C2&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph Istio 架构\n        A1[istiod 控制面] --&gt; B1[Envoy Sidecar]\n        A1 --&gt; C1[Envoy Sidecar]\n        A1 --&gt; D1[Istio Ingress Gateway]\n        B1 &lt;--&gt; C1\n    end\n    subgraph Linkerd 架构\n        A2[Control Plane] --&gt; B2[linkerd2-proxy]\n        A2 --&gt; C2[linkerd2-proxy]\n        A2 --&gt; D2[Linkerd Gateway]\n        B2 &lt;--&gt; C2\n    end</pre><p>Istio 与 Linkerd 核心对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>Istio</th>\n<th>Linkerd</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据面代理</td>\n<td>Envoy（C++）</td>\n<td>linkerd2-proxy（Rust）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制面</td>\n<td>istiod（单组件合并）</td>\n<td>多组件（destination、identity、proxy-injector）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>资源开销</td>\n<td>较高（Envoy ~50MB/实例）</td>\n<td>较低（proxy ~10MB/实例）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟开销</td>\n<td>P99 ~3-5ms</td>\n<td>P99 ~1-2ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能范围</td>\n<td>极其丰富（流量、安全、可观测）</td>\n<td>聚焦核心（mTLS、可观测、简单路由）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习曲线</td>\n<td>陡峭</td>\n<td>平缓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ambient 模式</td>\n<td>支持（无 Sidecar）</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多集群</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>通过网关模式支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WASM 扩展</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>大规模、复杂流量需求</td>\n<td>中小规模、快速上手</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"istio-流量管理\">Istio 流量管理</h2><p>Istio 通过 VirtualService、DestinationRule、Gateway 和 ServiceEntry 四种 CRD（自定义资源定义）实现精细化的流量管理。</p>\n<p>VirtualService 定义了请求到达服务后的路由规则，支持基于 URI、Header、Query Parameter 和端口的匹配条件。路由目标可以指向同一服务的不同子集（Subset），通过权重控制流量分配比例。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: networking.istio.io/v1beta1&#10;kind: VirtualService&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: webapp&#10;spec:&#10;  hosts:&#10;    - webapp&#10;  http:&#10;    - match:&#10;        - headers:&#10;            x-canary:&#10;              exact: &#39;true&#39;&#10;      route:&#10;        - destination:&#10;            host: webapp&#10;            subset: canary&#10;    - route:&#10;        - destination:&#10;            host: webapp&#10;            subset: stable&#10;          weight: 90&#10;        - destination:&#10;            host: webapp&#10;            subset: canary&#10;          weight: 10&#10;      timeout: 3s&#10;      retries:&#10;        attempts: 3&#10;        perTryTimeout: 1s&#10;        retryOn: 5xx,reset,connect-failure\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.istio.io/v1beta1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">VirtualService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  hosts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">headers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            x-canary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              exact</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'true'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">destination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            subset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">canary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">destination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            subset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">stable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">destination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            subset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">canary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          weight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      retries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        attempts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        perTryTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        retryOn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5xx,reset,connect-failure</span></span></code></pre></div><p>DestinationRule 定义了流量到达目标服务后的策略，包括连接池管理、异常检测（Outlier Detection）和子集定义。异常检测通过连续错误次数、错误率和检测间隔来识别不健康的实例，并将其从负载均衡池中临时移除。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: networking.istio.io/v1beta1&#10;kind: DestinationRule&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: webapp&#10;spec:&#10;  host: webapp&#10;  trafficPolicy:&#10;    connectionPool:&#10;      tcp:&#10;        maxConnections: 100&#10;      http:&#10;        h2UpgradePolicy: DEFAULT&#10;        http1MaxPendingRequests: 100&#10;        http2MaxRequests: 1000&#10;    outlierDetection:&#10;      consecutive5xxErrors: 5&#10;      interval: 10s&#10;      baseEjectionTime: 30s&#10;      maxEjectionPercent: 50&#10;  subsets:&#10;    - name: stable&#10;      labels:&#10;        version: v1&#10;    - name: canary&#10;      labels:&#10;        version: v2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.istio.io/v1beta1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DestinationRule</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">webapp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  trafficPolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    connectionPool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      tcp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        maxConnections</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        h2UpgradePolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DEFAULT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        http1MaxPendingRequests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        http2MaxRequests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    outlierDetection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      consecutive5xxErrors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      baseEjectionTime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      maxEjectionPercent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  subsets</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">stable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">canary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        version</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">v2</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Gateway 资源定义了网格边缘的入站流量接收策略，包括端口、协议和 TLS 证书配置。Istio Ingress Gateway 替代 Kubernetes Ingress 提供更丰富的流量管理能力。ServiceEntry 将外部服务注册到网格中，使 Istio 的流量策略（超时、重试、断路器）可以应用于外部依赖。</p>\n<h2 id=\"linkerd-快速上手\">Linkerd 快速上手</h2><p>Linkerd 以&quot;安装简单、运维简单&quot;为设计目标，通过 CLI 工具几分钟即可完成安装和网格注入。Linkerd 的控制面包含 destination（服务发现和配置）、identity（mTLS 证书管理）和 proxy-injector（自动注入 Sidecar）三个核心组件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"curl -sL https://run.linkerd.io/install | sh&#10;linkerd install --crds | kubectl apply -f -&#10;linkerd install | kubectl apply -f -&#10;linkerd check&#10;&#10;kubectl get deploy -n webapp -o yaml | linkerd inject - | kubectl apply -f -&#10;linkerd viz install | kubectl apply -f -&#10;linkerd viz dashboard\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">curl</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -sL</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://run.linkerd.io/install</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">linkerd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --crds</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apply</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> -</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">linkerd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apply</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> -</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">linkerd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> check</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> get</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> deploy</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> webapp</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -o</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> yaml</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> linkerd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> inject</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apply</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> -</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">linkerd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> viz</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> kubectl</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> apply</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> -</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">linkerd</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> viz</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dashboard</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Linkerd 的 ServiceProfile 资源定义了服务的路由和重试策略。与 Istio 的 VirtualService 相比，ServiceProfile 更简洁但功能更有限：支持基于路径的路由、每路由的超时和重试配置、以及请求级别的指标统计。</p>\n<p>Linkerd 的可观测性能力开箱即用：自动收集每个请求的成功率、延迟和吞吐量（Golden Metrics），通过 Linkerd Viz Dashboard 实时展示服务拓扑图和指标。<code>linkerd stat</code> 命令在终端中快速查看指定服务的流量统计，<code>linkerd tap</code> 实时查看通过网格的请求和响应详情。</p>\n<p>Linkerd 的 mTLS 在安装后自动启用，所有网格内流量默认加密。<code>linkerd edges</code> 命令可查看哪些服务间的连接已建立 mTLS，帮助验证网格覆盖范围。Linkerd 使用短期证书（24 小时有效期）并自动轮换，减少证书泄露的影响窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"故障注入与混沌测试\">故障注入与混沌测试</h2><p>服务网格的故障注入能力允许在不修改应用代码的情况下模拟各类网络故障，是混沌工程实践的重要工具。Istio 支持两种故障注入类型：延迟注入（模拟网络慢速）和中止注入（模拟服务错误）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: networking.istio.io/v1beta1&#10;kind: VirtualService&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: payment-service&#10;spec:&#10;  hosts:&#10;    - payment-service&#10;  http:&#10;    - fault:&#10;        delay:&#10;          percentage:&#10;            value: 10&#10;          fixedDelay: 3s&#10;        abort:&#10;          percentage:&#10;            value: 5&#10;          httpStatus: 503&#10;      route:&#10;        - destination:&#10;            host: payment-service\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">networking.istio.io/v1beta1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">VirtualService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">spec</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  hosts</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  http</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">fault</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        delay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          percentage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          fixedDelay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        abort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          percentage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            value</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          httpStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">503</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">destination</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">            host</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">payment-service</span></span></code></pre></div><p>故障注入的目标是验证系统在故障场景下的弹性行为：超时是否正确触发、断路器是否按预期打开、降级逻辑是否返回合理的备选结果、错误是否被正确隔离而非级联传播。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>故障类型</th>\n<th>注入方式</th>\n<th>验证目标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>网络延迟</td>\n<td>固定延迟/随机延迟</td>\n<td>超时配置和降级逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务错误</td>\n<td>HTTP 4xx/5xx 返回</td>\n<td>错误处理和断路器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>连接断开</td>\n<td>TCP reset</td>\n<td>重连和重试策略</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>带宽限制</td>\n<td>流量限速</td>\n<td>大文件传输场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DNS 故障</td>\n<td>DNS 响应延迟/失败</td>\n<td>服务发现容错</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>结合 Chaos Mesh 或 Litmus 等 Kubernetes 原生混沌工程工具，可以在更广泛的维度上注入故障（如 Pod 重启、节点网络分区、CPU/内存压力），与服务网格的流量级故障注入形成互补。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Istio 功能全面适合大规模复杂场景，Linkerd 轻量简洁适合快速上手</li>\n<li>Istio 通过 VirtualService 和 DestinationRule 实现精细化流量控制和弹性策略</li>\n<li>Linkerd 以极低资源开销（~10MB/代理）提供 mTLS、可观测性和基本路由</li>\n<li>故障注入是服务网格的独特能力，在代理层透明模拟网络故障</li>\n<li>选择标准：需要 WASM 扩展/Ambient 模式/多集群选 Istio，追求简洁和低开销选 Linkerd</li>\n<li>两者都提供开箱即用的可观测性，自动采集 Golden Metrics 并展示服务拓扑</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Istio 与 Linkerd 实战","id":"istio-与-linkerd-实战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Istio 流量管理","id":"istio-流量管理"},{"level":2,"text":"Linkerd 快速上手","id":"linkerd-快速上手"},{"level":2,"text":"故障注入与混沌测试","id":"故障注入与混沌测试"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"服务网格核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-mesh/service-mesh-concepts"},"next":{"title":"服务网格可观测性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/microservices-architecture/service-mesh/mesh-observability"}}